--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GAME DATA IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

rulekit reads a corpus of JSON files. It works with any rulebook, and it holds
no knowledge of any particular game. The corpora in data/ are examples.

Four of them were written for this project and are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0. Copy them freely:

  data/chess/         Chess
  data/texas-holdem/  Texas Hold'em poker
  data/estate-line/   An invented property trading game
  data/demo/          An invented trading card game

Every word in those four is original to this project. No rulebook, PDF, or web
page was copied to produce them. The rules of a game are a system, and a system
is not owned. A particular author's wording is owned, so none is reused.

One corpus is not ours:

  data/riftbound/     Reference data for the Riftbound trading card game. This
                      data is the property of Riot Games, Inc. The Apache
                      License does NOT cover it, and this project grants no
                      rights to it.

rulekit was created under Riot Games' "Legal Jibber Jabber" policy using assets
owned by Riot Games. Riot Games does not endorse or sponsor this project.

Riot's policy permits non-commercial community use only. To use rulekit
commercially, use one of the four public-domain corpora above, or supply your
own. docs/corpus-format.md states the format field by field.

